  "id": "psychological-skills-training",
  "term": "psychological skills training",
  "definition": "Psychological skills training is a structured approach used in sport psychology to help athletes prepare for the demands of performance by learning specific mental skills. It may involve both direct teaching and a collaborative process that supports athletes in learning to guide their own development.",
